    <ul>
      <li><strong>Skip link</strong> — keyboard users can jump to main content.</li>
      <li><strong>Focus states</strong> — visible dashed outline with offset.</li>
      <li><strong>Touch targets</strong> — minimum 44px for buttons and icon links.</li>
      <li><strong>Heading permalinks</strong> — sibling anchors beside headings with a visible focus ring, accessible labels, and a reduced-motion-safe <code>:target</code> highlight.</li>
      <li><strong>Color contrast</strong> — palettes are chosen for both dark and light modes.</li>
      <li><strong>Semantic HTML</strong> — native elements before ARIA.</li>
      <li><strong>Reduced motion</strong> — transitions and animations respect user preference.</li>
    </ul>
